OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 3 MAY
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores
OL,6,     GWagner's Siegfried Idyll - a
OL,7,     Gpiece written as a birthday
OL,8,     Gpresent for his wife. Featuring
OL,9,     Gmore musical gifts from J.S.
OL,10,     GBach, Bartok and Billie Holiday.
OL,11,G1500FMusic Matters: Music on the Front
OL,12,     FLine
OL,13,     GClive Myrie is in conversation
OL,14,     Gwith fellow journalists. He and
OL,15,     GCaroline share stories to reveal
OL,16,     Gthe power and significance of
OL,17,     Gmusic when reporting from extreme
OL,18,     Gconflict situations.
